# SecretBeans
# Written by Claude (Anthropic) with Edwin West, August 2026. See PROVENANCE.md.

# Never commit anyone's financial data to the public repo
*.journal
!templates/**/*.journal
*.csv
!templates/**/*.csv
.latest.*
config.psd1
!templates/config.psd1
reports/

# Build output. Release artifacts belong on the GitHub release page, not in the
# repository - committing them makes every clone carry every past build.
release/
*.zip
*.cat
*.sha256

# Code signing. metadata.json names the Azure signing endpoint, code signing
# account and certificate profile. It belongs outside the repository entirely
# (docs/SIGNING.md suggests C:\tools\); this is only a backstop in case a copy
# is ever made here by accident.
metadata.json
*.pfx
*.snk

# Sign CLI, if anyone installs it into the repo folder by accident. It belongs
# in C:\tools - it unpacks a whole dependency tree that is not ours to ship.
sign.exe
.store/
